---
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>스크립토리움 — 와인바 · 공방 | Scriptorium</title>
  <meta name="description" content="서울 서촌의 와인바이자 채식 필사 공방, 스크립토리움. 빛과 금박으로 채운 한 권의 책 같은 공간." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=UnifrakturMaguntia&family=Cormorant:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --parchment: #f0e6c8;
      --parchment-deep: #e6d8b0;
      --parchment-shadow: #d8c79a;
      --ink: #2a1f14;
      --rubric: #9a1b1b;
      --rubric-deep: #7a1212;
      --gold: #b8860b;
      --gold-light: #d4af37;
      --gold-pale: #e8d18a;
      --vine: #5a6b3a;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      color: var(--ink);
      background-color: var(--parchment);
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 15%, rgba(184,134,11,0.06), transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 85%, rgba(154,27,27,0.05), transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.015), transparent 70%);
      line-height: 1.8;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* parchment grain overlay */
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
      opacity: 0.5;
      mix-blend-mode: multiply;
      background-image:
        repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(120,90,40,0.02) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px),
        repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(120,90,40,0.015) 0 3px, transparent 3px 6px);
    }

    .wrap { position: relative; z-index: 2; }

    /* ---------- shared ---------- */
    .blackletter { font-family: 'UnifrakturMaguntia', 'Cormorant', serif; }
    .latin { font-family: 'Cormorant', 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; }

    .rubric { color: var(--rubric); }
    .gold { color: var(--gold); }

    .section {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6.5rem) clamp(1.4rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      position: relative;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.35rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--rubric);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: 'UnifrakturMaguntia', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
      font-weight: 400;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }
    .section-title .gold { color: var(--gold); }

    .ornament-rule {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin: 1.4rem auto 2.6rem;
      max-width: 420px;
      color: var(--gold);
    }
    .ornament-rule::before,
    .ornament-rule::after {
      content: "";
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
    }
    .ornament-rule svg { width: 30px; height: 30px; flex: none; }

    /* ---------- demo helper ---------- */

    /* ---------- HERO (manuscript cover) ---------- */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem) 1.2rem;
      position: relative;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%, rgba(212,175,55,0.12), transparent 60%),
        linear-gradient(160deg, var(--parchment) 0%, var(--parchment-deep) 100%);
    }

    .codex {
      position: relative;
      width: min(760px, 94vw);
      padding: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 5rem) clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,250,235,0.55), rgba(230,216,176,0.35));
      border: 2px solid var(--gold);
      box-shadow:
        0 0 0 6px var(--parchment),
        0 0 0 8px rgba(154,27,27,0.55),
        0 0 0 9px var(--gold),
        0 30px 70px -20px rgba(42,31,20,0.55);
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* corner illumination flourishes */
    .codex .corner {
      position: absolute;
      width: clamp(48px, 9vw, 82px);
      height: clamp(48px, 9vw, 82px);
      color: var(--rubric);
    }
    .codex .corner.tl { top: -2px; left: -2px; }
    .codex .corner.tr { top: -2px; right: -2px; transform: scaleX(-1); }
    .codex .corner.bl { bottom: -2px; left: -2px; transform: scaleY(-1); }
    .codex .corner.br { bottom: -2px; right: -2px; transform: scale(-1,-1); }

    .codex .anno-top {
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      letter-spacing: 0.32em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: clamp(0.72rem, 1.8vw, 0.95rem);
      color: var(--rubric);
      margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
    }

    .codex .glyph {
      font-family: 'UnifrakturMaguntia', serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .codex h1 {
      font-family: 'UnifrakturMaguntia', serif;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 11vw, 6.4rem);
      line-height: 0.95;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(212,175,55,0.4);
    }
    .codex h1 .rubric { color: var(--rubric); }

    .codex .subtitle {
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.9rem);
      color: var(--rubric-deep);
      margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    }

    .codex .lede {
      max-width: 50ch;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.2vw, 1.18rem);
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .codex .seal {
      display: inline-flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-top: 0.6rem;
    }
    .codex .seal .ring {
      width: 78px; height: 78px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      color: var(--parchment);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, var(--rubric), var(--rubric-deep) 70%);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px -4px rgba(122,18,18,0.6), inset 0 0 0 3px rgba(212,175,55,0.7);
      font-family: 'UnifrakturMaguntia', serif;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
    .codex .seal small {
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      color: var(--rubric);
    }

    .scroll-hint {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 1.6rem; left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--gold);
      animation: bob 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes bob { 0%,100% { transform: translate(-50%,0); } 50% { transform: translate(-50%,8px); } }

    /* ---------- WINE LIST ---------- */
    .wine-list {
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, var(--parchment-deep), var(--parchment));
    }

    .columns {
      column-count: 2;
      column-gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      column-rule: 1px solid rgba(184,134,11,0.35);
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .wine-entry {
      break-inside: avoid;
      margin-bottom: 1.7rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.3rem;
      border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(154,27,27,0.35);
    }
    .wine-entry:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

    .wine-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }
    .wine-head .name {
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-style: normal;
      font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.6vw, 1.55rem);
      color: var(--rubric);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .wine-head .dots {
      flex: 1;
      border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--gold);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      min-width: 1rem;
    }
    .wine-head .price {
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--gold);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .wine-meta {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--vine);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .wine-note {
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    .list-aside {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--rubric);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    /* ---------- STORY (drop cap, two column) ---------- */
    .story { position: relative; }
    .story .frame {
      border: 1px solid var(--gold);
      outline: 1px solid rgba(154,27,27,0.4);
      outline-offset: 5px;
      padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
      background: rgba(255,250,235,0.4);
      position: relative;
    }

    .story-body {
      column-count: 2;
      column-gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.1vw, 1.12rem);
      text-align: justify;
      hyphens: auto;
    }
    .story-body p { margin-bottom: 1rem; break-inside: avoid-column; }

    .dropcap::first-letter {
      font-family: 'UnifrakturMaguntia', serif;
      float: left;
      font-size: clamp(3.6rem, 11vw, 5.4rem);
      line-height: 0.72;
      padding: 0.1rem 0.55rem 0.2rem 0;
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
      color: var(--rubric);
      text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 var(--gold-pale), 2px 2px 0 rgba(184,134,11,0.5);
    }

    .marginalia {
      position: absolute;
      right: -10px; top: 40%;
      width: 60px;
      color: var(--vine);
      opacity: 0.85;
      display: none;
    }

    .craft-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.4rem;
      margin-top: 2.6rem;
    }
    .craft-card {
      border: 1px solid rgba(184,134,11,0.6);
      padding: 1.4rem 1.3rem;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,250,235,0.6), rgba(230,216,176,0.3));
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }
    .craft-card .ic { color: var(--rubric); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
    .craft-card h3 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: var(--rubric);
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }
    .craft-card p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--ink); }
    .craft-card .tag {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.6rem;
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--gold);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    /* ---------- RESERVATION ---------- */
    .reserve {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(154,27,27,0.08), transparent 60%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, var(--parchment), var(--parchment-deep));
    }
    .reserve-card {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      border: 2px solid var(--gold);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px var(--parchment), 0 0 0 6px rgba(154,27,27,0.45);
      padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
      background: rgba(255,250,235,0.5);
    }
    .reserve form { display: grid; gap: 1.1rem; }
    .field label {
      display: block;
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--rubric);
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
    }
    .field input, .field select, .field textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
      font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--parchment);
      border: 1px solid rgba(154,27,27,0.4);
      border-radius: 0;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .field input:focus, .field select:focus, .field textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--gold);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(184,134,11,0.25);
    }
    .field-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.1rem; }

    .seal-btn {
      justify-self: center;
      margin-top: 0.6rem;
      font-family: 'UnifrakturMaguntia', serif;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--parchment);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 25%, var(--rubric), var(--rubric-deep) 80%);
      border: 1px solid var(--gold);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px -5px rgba(122,18,18,0.6), inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(212,175,55,0.55);
      padding: 0.7rem 2.4rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
    }
    .seal-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 22px -6px rgba(122,18,18,0.7), inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(212,175,55,0.8);
    }

    .reserve-note {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 1.4rem;
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--rubric);
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }

    /* ---------- CONTACT / COLOPHON ---------- */
    .colophon {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--ink), #1a130b);
      color: var(--parchment);
    }
    .colophon .section { color: var(--parchment); }
    .colophon .section-title { color: var(--gold-light); }
    .colophon .eyebrow { color: var(--gold-pale); }
    .colophon .ornament-rule { color: var(--gold-light); }

    .colophon-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .colophon-item h4 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold-light);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .colophon-item p { color: var(--parchment-deep); font-size: 1rem; }
    .colophon-item a { color: var(--gold-pale); text-decoration: none; }
    .colophon-item a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .colophon-final {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: 'Cormorant', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--gold-pale);
      line-height: 1.9;
    }
    .colophon-final .blackletter { font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--gold-light); }
    .colophon-final .legal {
      margin-top: 1.2rem;
      font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;
      font-style: normal;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: rgba(240,230,200,0.5);
    }

    @media (min-width: 1024px) {
      .marginalia { display: block; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .columns { column-count: 1; }
      .story-body { column-count: 1; }
      .field-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .scroll-hint { animation: none; }
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- DEMO BAR -->
  <div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
    <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
    <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 15 · 스크립토리움 — 중세 채식 필사본 스타일</span>
    <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
  </div>
  <div style="height:40px;"></div>

  <div class="wrap">

    <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="codex">
        <svg class="corner tl" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M4 4 H50 C30 8 12 18 8 50 V4 Z" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.12"/>
          <path d="M4 4 H46 M4 4 V46" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
          <path d="M10 10 C34 12 12 34 10 50 C8 30 8 30 10 10 Z" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/>
          <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="3" fill="var(--gold)"/>
        </svg>
        <svg class="corner tr" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M4 4 H50 C30 8 12 18 8 50 V4 Z" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.12"/>
          <path d="M4 4 H46 M4 4 V46" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
          <path d="M10 10 C34 12 12 34 10 50 C8 30 8 30 10 10 Z" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/>
          <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="3" fill="var(--gold)"/>
        </svg>
        <svg class="corner bl" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M4 4 H50 C30 8 12 18 8 50 V4 Z" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.12"/>
          <path d="M4 4 H46 M4 4 V46" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
          <path d="M10 10 C34 12 12 34 10 50 C8 30 8 30 10 10 Z" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/>
          <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="3" fill="var(--gold)"/>
        </svg>
        <svg class="corner br" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M4 4 H50 C30 8 12 18 8 50 V4 Z" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.12"/>
          <path d="M4 4 H46 M4 4 V46" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
          <path d="M10 10 C34 12 12 34 10 50 C8 30 8 30 10 10 Z" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/>
          <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="3" fill="var(--gold)"/>
        </svg>

        <p class="anno-top">Anno Domini · 서촌 · 와인과 채식 필사</p>
        <div class="glyph">❦ ✦ ❦</div>
        <h1>S<span class="rubric">criptorium</span></h1>
        <p class="subtitle">스크립토리움 — 빛으로 쓰는 와인바 · 공방</p>
        <p class="lede">
          한 잔의 포도주와 한 줄의 금박. 중세 수도원의 필사실(scriptorium)에서
          이름을 빌려온 이곳은, 와인을 따르고 글자에 빛을 입히는
          작은 코덱스 같은 공간입니다.
        </p>
        <div class="seal">
          <div class="ring">S</div>
          <small>Vinum &amp; Litterae · 서울 서촌</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="scroll-hint">↓ 책장을 넘기듯이</div>
    </header>

    <!-- ============ WINE LIST ============ -->
    <section class="wine-list" id="wine">
      <div class="section">
        <p class="eyebrow">Liber Vini · 와인 목록</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">잔에 <span class="gold">담긴</span> 채식</h2>
        <div class="ornament-rule">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2C9 7 4 8 4 13a8 8 0 0016 0c0-5-5-6-8-11Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/><path d="M12 9v9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1"/></svg>
        </div>

        <div class="columns">
          <div class="wine-entry">
            <div class="wine-head">
              <span class="name">상세르 블랑</span>
              <span class="dots"></span>
              <span class="price">14,000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="wine-meta">Sancerre Blanc · 루아르, 소비뇽 블랑 · 잔</div>
            <p class="wine-note">백자갈 위의 부싯돌 향. 첫 페이지를 여는 흰 여백 같은 산미.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wine-entry">
            <div class="wine-head">
              <span class="name">바롤로</span>
              <span class="dots"></span>
              <span class="price">22,000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="wine-meta">Barolo · 피에몬테, 네비올로 · 잔</div>
            <p class="wine-note">장미와 타르, 마른 잉크. 오래 묵힌 채식 본문처럼 깊습니다.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wine-entry">
            <div class="wine-head">
              <span class="name">샤블리 프르미에 크뤼</span>
              <span class="dots"></span>
              <span class="price">18,000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="wine-meta">Chablis 1er Cru · 부르고뉴, 샤르도네 · 잔</div>
            <p class="wine-note">굴 껍데기 같은 미네랄. 금박 입히기 전 닦아낸 양피지 향.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wine-entry">
            <div class="wine-head">
              <span class="name">에트나 로쏘</span>
              <span class="dots"></span>
              <span class="price">16,000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="wine-meta">Etna Rosso · 시칠리아, 네렐로 마스칼레제 · 잔</div>
            <p class="wine-note">화산재와 붉은 자두. 적갈색 머리글자(rubric)를 닮은 빛깔.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wine-entry">
            <div class="wine-head">
              <span class="name">자연주의 펫낫</span>
              <span class="dots"></span>
              <span class="price">15,000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="wine-meta">Pét-Nat · 충북 영동, 청수 품종 · 잔</div>
            <p class="wine-note">국내 자연효모 발포. 거친 기포가 필사가의 잉크 튀김 같습니다.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wine-entry">
            <div class="wine-head">
              <span class="name">토카이 5 푸토뇨스</span>
              <span class="dots"></span>
              <span class="price">19,000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="wine-meta">Tokaji 5 Puttonyos · 헝가리, 귀부 · 잔</div>
            <p class="wine-note">꿀과 살구. 마지막 콜로폰에 어울리는 황금빛 마침표.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:3rem;">Cibus · 안주</p>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4.5vw,2.8rem);">필사가의 <span class="gold">식탁</span></h2>
        <div class="ornament-rule" style="max-width:340px;">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3v8M6 11c0 2-2 2-2 5s4 5 8 5 8-3 8-5-2-3-2-5V3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1"/></svg>
        </div>

        <div class="columns">
          <div class="wine-entry">
            <div class="wine-head">
              <span class="name">수도원식 채소 테린</span>
              <span class="dots"></span>
              <span class="price">16,000</span>
            </div>
            <p class="wine-note">뿌리채소 7종을 켜켜이 눌러 굳힌 테린, 허브 머스터드.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wine-entry">
            <div class="wine-head">
              <span class="name">구운 버섯과 호두 페스토</span>
              <span class="dots"></span>
              <span class="price">14,000</span>
            </div>
            <p class="wine-note">표고·새송이·느타리, 호두 페스토와 발효 마늘.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wine-entry">
            <div class="wine-head">
              <span class="name">금박 무화과 카나페</span>
              <span class="dots"></span>
              <span class="price">12,000</span>
            </div>
            <p class="wine-note">반건조 무화과, 캐슈 리코타, 식용 금박 한 점.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wine-entry">
            <div class="wine-head">
              <span class="name">서촌 두부 라구</span>
              <span class="dots"></span>
              <span class="price">15,000</span>
            </div>
            <p class="wine-note">손두부와 렌틸 라구, 직접 구운 통밀 빵 한 조각.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="list-aside">— 모든 음식은 100% 식물성. 잔술은 매주 화요일 새 목록으로 갱신됩니다 —</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ STORY / CRAFT ============ -->
    <section class="story" id="story">
      <div class="section">
        <p class="eyebrow">Historia · 공방 이야기</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">빛을 <span class="gold">입히는</span> 손</h2>
        <div class="ornament-rule">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l2.4 5.6L20 9l-4 4 1 6-5-3-5 3 1-6-4-4 5.6-1.4L12 2Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1"/></svg>
        </div>

        <div class="frame">
          <svg class="marginalia" viewBox="0 0 60 220" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M30 6C18 30 42 44 30 70C18 96 42 110 30 136C18 162 42 176 30 202"
              stroke="var(--vine)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
            <path d="M30 30c-10-4-16 2-16 2s8 6 16 0Z" fill="var(--vine)" opacity="0.6"/>
            <path d="M30 96c10-4 16 2 16 2s-8 6-16 0Z" fill="var(--rubric)" opacity="0.5"/>
            <path d="M30 162c-10-4-16 2-16 2s8 6 16 0Z" fill="var(--gold)" opacity="0.6"/>
            <circle cx="30" cy="208" r="4" fill="var(--rubric)"/>
          </svg>

          <div class="story-body">
            <p class="dropcap">
              스크립토리움은 2019년, 서촌의 오래된 한옥 골목 끝에서 시작했습니다.
              낮에는 채식(彩飾) 필사를 가르치는 공방이고, 해가 지면 그 책상 위에
              잔이 놓이는 와인바가 됩니다. 우리는 글자에 빛을 입히는 일과
              포도주에 시간을 담는 일이 본질적으로 같다고 믿습니다.
            </p>
            <p>
              중세의 필사가들은 한 권의 책을 완성하는 데 몇 해를 들였습니다.
              송아지 가죽을 무두질해 양피지를 만들고, 청금석을 갈아
              울트라마린을 얻고, 진짜 금을 얇게 두드려 글자 위에 올렸지요.
              우리의 한 잔도 그 속도로 따릅니다.
            </p>
            <p>
              메뉴판은 인쇄하지 않습니다. 매일 아침 직접 펜으로 적고,
              머리글자를 적갈색과 금색으로 칠합니다. 손님이 받는 것은
              음료 목록이 아니라, 그날 하루의 작은 필사본 한 장입니다.
            </p>
            <p>
              우리는 모든 음식을 식물에서 얻습니다. 화려함이 아니라
              절제와 정교함으로 — 수도원의 식탁이 그러했듯이.
              빛은 늘 여백에서 옵니다.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="craft-grid">
          <div class="craft-card">
            <svg class="ic" width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 3l5 5-11 11-5 1 1-5L16 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/><path d="M14 5l5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>
            <h3>채식 필사 클래스</h3>
            <p>금박 입히기와 머리글자 그리기를 배우는 2시간 워크숍.</p>
            <span class="tag">매주 토 · 일 14:00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="craft-card">
            <svg class="ic" width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3C9 8 4 9 4 14a8 8 0 0016 0c0-5-5-6-8-11Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>
            <h3>잔술 페어링</h3>
            <p>채식 안주 4종과 자연주의 와인 4잔을 잇는 저녁 코스.</p>
            <span class="tag">평일 저녁 예약제</span>
          </div>
          <div class="craft-card">
            <svg class="ic" width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h11l3 3v13H5V4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/><path d="M16 4v3h3M8 11h8M8 15h6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1"/></svg>
            <h3>코덱스 대여</h3>
            <p>소규모 모임을 위한 한옥 별채, 직접 만든 메뉴 코덱스 증정.</p>
            <span class="tag">최대 8인 · 사전 협의</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ RESERVATION ============ -->
    <section class="reserve" id="reserve">
      <div class="section">
        <p class="eyebrow">Reservatio · 예약</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">자리를 <span class="gold">청하다</span></h2>
        <div class="ornament-rule">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h16M4 7l2 12h12l2-12M9 7V5a3 3 0 016 0v2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1"/></svg>
        </div>

        <div class="reserve-card">
          <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); this.querySelector('.seal-btn').textContent='✓ 청원이 봉인됨'; this.querySelector('.seal-btn').disabled=true;">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="name">청하는 이의 이름</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="성함을 적어 주십시오" required />
            </div>
            <div class="field-row">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="date">날짜</label>
                <input id="date" name="date" type="date" required />
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="time">시각</label>
                <select id="time" name="time" required>
                  <option value="">선택</option>
                  <option>18:00</option>
                  <option>19:00</option>
                  <option>20:00</option>
                  <option>21:00</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="field-row">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="party">인원</label>
                <select id="party" name="party" required>
                  <option value="">선택</option>
                  <option>1인</option>
                  <option>2인</option>
                  <option>3인</option>
                  <option>4인</option>
                  <option>5인 이상</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="phone">연락처</label>
                <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="010-0000-0000" required />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="note">남기실 말씀</label>
              <textarea id="note" name="note" rows="3" placeholder="채식 페어링, 클래스, 별채 대여 등"></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="seal-btn">청원에 봉인 찍기</button>
          </form>
          <p class="reserve-note">— 예약은 봉인(seal)으로 확정되며, 당일 전화로 한 번 더 확인드립니다 —</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ CONTACT / COLOPHON ============ -->
    <footer class="colophon" id="contact">
      <div class="section">
        <p class="eyebrow">Colophon · 맺음</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">스크립토리움</h2>
        <div class="ornament-rule">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M5 6l7-4 7 4M5 18l7 4 7-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1"/></svg>
        </div>

        <div class="colophon-grid">
          <div class="colophon-item">
            <h4>Locus · 위치</h4>
            <p>서울 종로구 서촌<br/>자하문로 12길 7, 한옥 별채</p>
          </div>
          <div class="colophon-item">
            <h4>Horae · 영업</h4>
            <p>화–일 17:00–24:00<br/>클래스 토·일 14:00 / 월 휴무</p>
          </div>
          <div class="colophon-item">
            <h4>Vox · 연락</h4>
            <p><a href="tel:02-372-1419">02-372-1419</a><br/><a href="mailto:hello@scriptorium.kr">hello@scriptorium.kr</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="colophon-final">
          <span class="blackletter">❦ Vinum &amp; Litterae ❦</span><br/>
          포도주와 글자, 그리고 한 점의 금박.<br/>
